{"step_index":200,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T19:08:05Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-29T00:38:05+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-29T00:38:11+05:30\nThe search for \"\"TUNG TUNG TUNG SAHUR\" Spider-Man GTA YouTube how they make animated superhero challenge videos kids content\" returned the following summary:\nThe content you are referring to—often featuring **Spider-Man** and a character or trend named **\"Tung Tung Tung Sahur\"** in a **GTA 5** environment—is part of a massive, specific sub-genre of YouTube videos that combine popular superhero characters with the sandbox gameplay of *Grand Theft Auto V*[1][2][3].\n\n### How These Videos Are Made\nThese videos are not traditional hand-drawn animations; they are created using the PC version of *GTA V* and a variety of modding tools[3][4]. The production process generally follows these steps:\n\n*   **GTA 5 Mods:** Creators use mods (modifications) to import custom character models into the game[3]. This is how Spider-Man, Hulk, or other superheroes appear in the game world, as they are not original characters[3][5].\n*   **Director Mode & Scene Tools:** Using tools like \"Rockstar Editor,\" \"Menyoo Trainer,\" or \"Scene Director,\" creators can control character movements, spawn objects, change weather conditions, and set up complex scenarios without needing to manually animate every frame[3][6].\n*   **Custom Maps & Ramps:** Many of these videos feature \"Rainbow Bridges\" or elaborate obstacle courses[7][2][8]. Creators build these custom stunt maps within the game to host races or challenges between characters[9].\n*   **Editing:** After filming the gameplay from various cinematic angles, creators use video editing software to cut the footage together, add music, and incorporate trending audio or memes (like the \"Tung Tung Tung Sahur\" trend) to increase engagement[9][10].\n\n### About the \"Tung Tung Tung Sahur\" Trend\n\"Tung Tung Tung Sahur\" originated as a viral trend—often associated with the Islamic tradition of waking people up for Sahur (the pre-dawn meal during Ramadan)—that evolved into a meme, dance, or character theme on social media[11]\n<truncated 2386 bytes>\nWtznoAgJ3MFvYmtw=)\n[9] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEaCVFhpxKJ3p85IajoVb9MC_176txw08coTAIZL96zpoEHI2Yl5WgG4oWnDBM74x2FKeh1ulNr0IyBqry5wPgfjXalrQRq2UEGfe_9z4eR0YVF5HSW_14nCAtfwB2m8EA=)\n[10] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEWdANoo1lS0BaN3yadUhMYB7lKUofOQAO727qyY36TCzHr67MZgi5FoVFdvR5NFf5_Khetwlyjk3xMyg4Km75FVkJo0Yo80TzMZCw5P-6XVkYw8Nc0LqUGC8reOhxLTCk=)\n[11] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGwICL9CRMOmxvHcsf-wbVFWOCGx_9-_upVXm6MHFkJ2SLYREI3UTHS2V-3cSbiZdc2JrGpO87DVC1yoDCDctuSRtJuM3LYi8FzYzpOdat373M_RUSjgTlrvsWlBY3i5Q==)\n[12] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG3HXGDmRCTJMWzqgdfHpmxNVL5vW1ZBdxu7BnBCqK5SJCMohOjKt3jZb8_UZ8KhQ3hfrJDVrO9durccXW9j-DLlHfE-T8UTHA7RzFBqcqSevoP7-wesdfv5uPnm1IA5w8=)\n[13] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGDhjox0ELt4LOXuxjO-fShrYXZTjXHxupqKVUPeYVaQ7M9JVVJ7BRjMx4Y2ujwRzRwYv6bedyXmsNd0YcyyEY5barPZKJetwaQJkqkYPe-1th-MadE-8DGgHWS5Pd7ww==)\n[14] [kotaku.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG3vipiUlsoFEQKJUWnCLISGpfE-pTar6fY3yRF4XSqFEb3ueqA0eBljWCnNasxUm-xMdzh30PkjFlXWQTiaEdMN6KWFT_Jr5wp2GT7cNGPB7fX9daUQvON1IAckN6dmFV47xm9ioDEpmkf6YHsH_mlutsSLsSXh--NZg6XmioOjspLNHEAZtTRXg==)\n[15] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEzuXK3UHemIJ0J3n6AxHIqpUTzPXLFnLqj5IVvR3kHrySIT-a05uvJmGcuLV3BLhQD2rcsPNSdgg8F5il6GJl54nPYXfyefA2tVFrUCTECKJeLMErAUS2Cj6scZBlHhg8=)\n[16] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFo4WHFCxCnGZ5BSV39pvnQYc5zRN-ve3G18GY2y-y5qlcpWPu3Pwe74fI_dn5KhCtfHx9rYy-Rf1