,000 (on sale) |\\n| **Script Hook V** | Required to run any GTA mods | Free |\\n| **Script Hook V .NET** | Required for script mods | Free |\\n| **OpenIV** | Install/manage game file mods | Free |\\n| **AddonPeds** | Add custom character models (Spider-Man etc.) | Free |\\n| **JulioNIB Spider-Man Script** | Spider-Man powers (web swing, wall crawl) | **$10-15 (Patreon)** |\\n| **Menyoo Trainer** | Spawn objects, build stunts, control scenes | Free |\\n| **Map Editor / Custom Maps** | Rainbow bridges, ramps, obstacle courses | Free (community maps) |\\n| **OBS Studio** | Screen recording | Free |\\n| **Da\n<truncated 6290 bytes>","Description":"\"Complete guide on how to create GTA Spider-Man YouTube content like MARINARA\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\renu5\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697\\\\marinara_how_to_create.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating content guide\"","toolSummary":"\"Content creation guide\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
